  "version": 1,
  "title": "Generalized Oberwolfach problem: prescribed 2-factor decompositions",
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization of a prescribed 2-factor decomposition theorem for sufficiently large even-regular graphs. The minimum-degree threshold is determined by ordinary cycle-decomposition thresholds for an arbitrary nonempty set of permitted cycle lengths; the order threshold is uniform in that set and in the prescribed list of factors.",
